## Packet Output Comparison

A verified Retail 12.1.5.70783 PKT was processed using the original TrinityCore WPP and the independent Elysium Retail WPP.

Both executions used byte-identical source capture data.

The resulting SQL contained:

- 428 executable SQL statements.
- 41 database tables.
- 8,018 value rows.
- Identical packet-derived SQL data.

The only SQL difference was the automatically generated parsing-date comment.

After excluding that metadata line, the SQL outputs were byte-identical.

The corresponding parsed-text outputs also matched after excluding their parsing-date metadata.

This demonstrates equivalent output for that particular capture and configuration, not universal compatibility with every supported client version.

### Historical SQL Research

An additional historical audit examined apparent differences in Northshire starting-zone SQL output.

The differing files were associated with build 68974, and evidence of manual editing was identified.

No confirmed WPP SQL generator defect was established.

Consequently, no SQL generator modification was made based on those differences.

